    {
      "target": "Strings/1_6_Strings",
      "key": "DesertFestival_Pam",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, kid... You takin' the day off? It's nice to kick back every once in a while, isn't it?#$e#Yep... Even ol' Pam needs some sunlight on her skin now and then! Just wake me up before I turn into leather... Heheh.",
      "translation": "Hej, děcko... Máš dnes volno? Jednou za čas je příjemné hodit nohy nahoru, viď?#$e#Jasně... I stará Pam občas potřebuje trochu slunce na kůži! Jen mě vzbuď, než se proměním v brašnu... Hehehe.",
      "sourceSHA256": "5d0ce38933dcca684a48bc85119b572c3cd99140538b0cbebd031248688e7d4c",
      "translationSHA256": "fe1fabfa7594df93c93f6c2384b4e666175b7f96291487a2801f4ce58773d433",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
