    {
      "target": "Strings/1_6_Strings",
      "key": "DesertFestival_Robin",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey @. We're just chewing the fat over here. I don't see these guys very often, even though we're neighbors!",
      "translation": "Ahoj, @. Jen tu spolu klábosíme. I když jsme sousedé, tyhle chlapíky moc často nevídám!",
      "sourceSHA256": "18fa72b0584a77bb21d0c1b09365a206d63f9d5b676e2452808519a81953af57",
      "translationSHA256": "dc420bbf5a572fbab69ca08b8ff3b44c571257d18dfe6585086ebcc05e5d56cc",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
